smb: client: get rid of TCP_Server_Info::refpath_lock

jira KERNEL-814
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10
commit-author Paulo Alcantara <pc@manguebit.com>
commit 0a9b00e5e5c5fc3c77cbfd01e6ffbe77fc7fe74a
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10/0a9b00e5.failed

TCP_Server_Info::leaf_fullpath is allocated in cifs_get_tcp_session()
and never changed afterwards, so there is no need to serialize its
access.

	Signed-off-by: Paulo Alcantara (Red Hat) <pc@manguebit.com>
	Signed-off-by: Steve French <stfrench@microsoft.com>
(cherry picked from commit 0a9b00e5e5c5fc3c77cbfd01e6ffbe77fc7fe74a)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

